    "body": "Closes #985\nReferences #983\nReferences #986\n\n## Outcome\n\nReconciles the authoritative geometric-intelligence roadmap after #983 closed at `UNAVAILABLE_ZERO_CONSTRUCTION_TRANSFER` and makes #986 the only active local qualification ahead of parked #953.\n\n## Updated direction\n\n- separates immutable prime/zeta/H4/Cl(0,6)/SpiralCore address and transport from corpus-induced semantic placement/value;\n- freezes `HarmonicLinkState7` as a per-route self-plus-six directed PPMI link-state hypothesis, with OSPF used only as the bounded link-state analogy;\n- tests candidate-relative signed zero-sum transport against placement, link, distance, causal, unsigned, recall/count, and table-native controls;\n- uses canonical vertex-disjoint matched pairs, audit-only pair metadata, equal full-sweep work, shared label-free induction scales, and two equal-budget score-family calibration margins;\n- requires the full-versus-table uplift to pass the same exact pair-blocked test;\n- preserves a decision-bearing table-value fallback when semantic value transfers but geometry adds no causal uplift;\n- keeps fixed zeta data pinned, permits compiler-side Rust algebra/float during qualification, and defers base-256/integer/LUT lowering until causal transfer.\n\n## Programme state\n\n- **Now:** #986 only.\n- **Next:** #953 -> #973 -> #954.\n- **Later:** #955 -> #962 -> #963 -> #964 -> #965.\n\nThe native issue graph, #820, milestone 21, #953, #973, and the closed #983 handoff have been synchronized. Novelty, attention capability, semantic placement, generation, correctness, and reasoning remain unestablished.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` — PASS\n- staged/committed whitespace check — PASS\n- final independent contract reconciliation audit — CLEAN\n- code, model, corpus, teacher, generation, workspace, performance, formal, and release tests — `NOT_RUN` (documentation/governance-only change)\n",
